@base = http://localhost:8102

### ── Modelo anémico ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Crear: el total se calcula con double
# @name anemic
POST {{base}}/api/anemic/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "ana", "lines": [
  {"sku": "INV-001", "unitPrice": 0.1, "quantity": 1},
  {"sku": "INV-002", "unitPrice": 0.2, "quantity": 1}
]}

### Agregar 50 unidades: se acepta y el total no cambia
POST {{base}}/api/anemic/orders/{{anemic.response.body.id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "INV-003", "unitPrice": 5, "quantity": 50}

### Cualquier estado
PUT {{base}}/api/anemic/orders/{{anemic.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "banana"}

### ── Agregado Order ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Crear un borrador
# @name order
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "ana", "currency": "PEN"}

### Agregar líneas (el total se calcula solo)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "INV-001", "unitPrice": 19.99, "quantity": 2}

### Más de 10 unidades → 422 MAX_QUANTITY_EXCEEDED
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "INV-001", "unitPrice": 19.99, "quantity": 9}

### Otra moneda → 422 CURRENCY_MISMATCH
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "INV-002", "unitPrice": 5, "currency": "USD", "quantity": 1}

### Confirmar → publica OrderConfirmed
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/confirm

### Editar un pedido confirmado → 409 ORDER_NOT_EDITABLE
DELETE {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/lines/INV-001

### Pagar, enviar, cancelar
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/pay

###
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/ship

###
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/cancel

### Eventos de dominio publicados
GET {{base}}/api/events
